    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tank Core&quot; is a 2D top-down shooter game infused with Roguelike elements. Players will collect various random tank components in levels, including turrets, chassis, shells, modules, and cores, to assemble unique tanks that will protect base and defeat all enemies encountered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/631f23c529018e5b9d62777b75d7b38a.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/631f23c529018e5b9d62777b75d7b38a.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/631f23c529018e5b9d62777b75d7b38a.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Combination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By installing various collected tank components, you can create unique combat strategies. These components include turrets, chassis, shells, and modules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4977aab58633f4f33cb8ecd7c7a2938d.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4977aab58633f4f33cb8ecd7c7a2938d.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4977aab58633f4f33cb8ecd7c7a2938d.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Cores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various cores will provide your tank with comprehensive passive bonuses, and there\u2019s no limit to the number of cores you can equip. Melt down extra turrets and bases to forge specific cores, which will retain some effects of the original components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4c29daa8d1ba94e31446fd83a189bfd3.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4c29daa8d1ba94e31446fd83a189bfd3.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4c29daa8d1ba94e31446fd83a189bfd3.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complex Terrain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemies in a variety of complex terrains where the landscape is both an obstacle and an ally. Interact with or destroy the terrain as needed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/5873f6ff5b072ddc8fe03151ba43e0ef.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/5873f6ff5b072ddc8fe03151ba43e0ef.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/5873f6ff5b072ddc8fe03151ba43e0ef.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special terrain pieces in the editor by continually fighting. Create your own custom levels according to your preferences.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tank Core&quot; is a 2D top-down shooter game infused with Roguelike elements. Players will collect various random tank components in levels, including turrets, chassis, shells, modules, and cores, to assemble unique tanks that will protect base and defeat all enemies encountered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/631f23c529018e5b9d62777b75d7b38a.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/631f23c529018e5b9d62777b75d7b38a.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/631f23c529018e5b9d62777b75d7b38a.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Combination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By installing various collected tank components, you can create unique combat strategies. These components include turrets, chassis, shells, and modules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4977aab58633f4f33cb8ecd7c7a2938d.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4977aab58633f4f33cb8ecd7c7a2938d.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4977aab58633f4f33cb8ecd7c7a2938d.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Cores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various cores will provide your tank with comprehensive passive bonuses, and there\u2019s no limit to the number of cores you can equip. Melt down extra turrets and bases to forge specific cores, which will retain some effects of the original components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4c29daa8d1ba94e31446fd83a189bfd3.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4c29daa8d1ba94e31446fd83a189bfd3.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/4c29daa8d1ba94e31446fd83a189bfd3.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complex Terrain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemies in a variety of complex terrains where the landscape is both an obstacle and an ally. Interact with or destroy the terrain as needed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/5873f6ff5b072ddc8fe03151ba43e0ef.poster.avif?t=1749311674\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/5873f6ff5b072ddc8fe03151ba43e0ef.webm?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430070/extras/5873f6ff5b072ddc8fe03151ba43e0ef.mp4?t=1749311674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special terrain pieces in the editor by continually fighting. Create your own custom levels according to your preferences.</p>",
